    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.tabline\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12.x\n\n### Description\n\nWhat happens:\nNeovim crashes after trying to add new plugin with mini.tabline and mini.icons present.\n\n### Reproduction\n\n1. Create separate 'nvim-repro' config directory:\n    - '~/.config/nvim-repro/' on Unix\n    - '~/AppData/Local/nvim-repro/' on Windows\n\n2. Inside 'nvim-repro' directory create a file named 'init.lua'.\n   Populate it with the following content:\n\n    ```lua\n    vim.pack.add({ \"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim\" })\n    \n    require(\"mini.tabline\").setup()\n    require(\"mini.icons\").setup()\n\n    -- vim.pack.add({ \"https://github.com/neogitorg/neogit\" })\n    ```\n3. Run `NVIM_APPNAME=nvim-repro nvim` (i.e. execute `nvim` with `NVIM_APPNAME` environment variable set to \"nvim-repro\").\n   Wait for all dependencies to install.\n4. Open init.lua and uncomment neogit (can be any other plugin, its just an example). Save and close neovim\n5. Run `NVIM_APPNAME=nvim-repro nvim`\n6. Regardless of yes/no/always during plugin install prompt there is an error:\n\nError message:\n\n```Error in /home/user/.config/nvim-repro/init.lua:\nE5113: Lua chunk: Vim:E5108: Lua: /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/filetype/detect.lua:334: bad argument #1 to 'find\n' (string expected, got nil)\nstack traceback:\n        [C]: in function 'find'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/filetype/detect.lua:334: in function 'conf'\n        vim/filetype.lua: in function 'filetype_match'\n        ...im-repro/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/icons.lua:2190: in function 'getter'\n        ...im-repro/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/icons.lua:484: in function 'get'\n        ...-repro/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/tabline.lua:553: in function 'get_icon'\n        ...-repro/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/tabline.lua:183: in function 'format'\n        ...-repro/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/tabline.lua:399: in function 'finalize_labels'\n        ...-repro/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/tabline.lua:164: in function <...-repro/site/pack/core/opt/\nmini.nvim/lua/mini/tabline.lua:159>\n        [C]: in function 'confirm'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/pack.lua:575: in function 'confirm_install'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/pack.lua:715: in function 'install_list'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/pack.lua:1027: in function 'add'\n        /home/user/.config/nvim-repro/init.lua:6: in main chunk\nstack traceback:\n        [C]: in function 'confirm'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/pack.lua:575: in function 'confirm_install'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/pack.lua:715: in function 'install_list'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/pack.lua:1027: in function 'add'\n        /home/user/.config/nvim-repro/init.lua:6: in main chunk\n```\nIt only occurs while running neovim with no other parameters (file paths etc.)\n\n",
